# A Nano clone (CH340) with the old ATmegaBOOT at 57600: at 115200 it hears garbage and answers
# none of the two attempts of three tries, then a fresh DTR pulse at 57600 finds it
! identity 1a86:7523
! baud 115200
! signals dtr=0 rts=0
! sleep 250
! signals dtr=1 rts=1
! sleep 50
> 30 20
< 80 f8
> 30 20
> 30 20
! signals dtr=0 rts=0
! sleep 250
! signals dtr=1 rts=1
! sleep 50
> 30 20
> 30 20
> 30 20
! baud 57600
! signals dtr=0 rts=0
! sleep 250
! signals dtr=1 rts=1
! sleep 50
> 30 20
< 14 10
> 75 20
< 14 1e 95 0f 10
